{"seq":3,"slug":"key-exchange-signatures","title":"密钥交换与数字签名","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/applied-cryptography/public-key/key-exchange-signatures","wordCount":1520,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"密钥交换与数字签名\">密钥交换与数字签名</h1><p>公钥密码的真正威力不在于「用公钥加密」本身，而在于它衍生出的两件利器：让两个素未谋面的人在公开信道上协商出一把共享密钥（密钥交换），以及让任何人都能验证某条消息确实出自某个私钥持有者且未被篡改（数字签名）。前者解决了对称加密的密钥分发死结，后者支撑起整个数字信任体系——证书、软件签名、区块链交易、登录令牌，无一例外。这一章把这两条主线讲透，它们是连接公钥原语与实际协议的关键纽带。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>密钥交换与数字签名虽都建立在离散对数/分解难题上，但目标正相反：密钥交换追求保密性（产出一把只有双方知道的密钥），数字签名追求真实性与不可否认性（产出一段任何人可验、唯本人可造的凭据）。两者的运算方向也相反——签名用私钥「锁」、公钥「验」，恰与加密的公钥「锁」、私钥「开」对称。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  subgraph 密钥交换&#10;    A1[Alice 私钥 a] --&gt; M1[&quot;共享密钥 = a·B = b·A&quot;]&#10;    B1[Bob 私钥 b] --&gt; M1&#10;    A1 --&gt; PA[Alice 公钥 A=aG]&#10;    B1 --&gt; PB[Bob 公钥 B=bG]&#10;  end&#10;  subgraph 数字签名&#10;    S1[私钥签名] --&gt; SIG[签名 = Sign 私钥, H 消息]&#10;    SIG --&gt; V1[公钥验证]&#10;    V1 --&gt; R{有效?}&#10;  end\">flowchart TD\n  subgraph 密钥交换\n    A1[Alice 私钥 a] --&gt; M1[\"共享密钥 = a·B = b·A\"]\n    B1[Bob 私钥 b] --&gt; M1\n    A1 --&gt; PA[Alice 公钥 A=aG]\n    B1 --&gt; PB[Bob 公钥 B=bG]\n  end\n  subgraph 数字签名\n    S1[私钥签名] --&gt; SIG[签名 = Sign 私钥, H 消息]\n    SIG --&gt; V1[公钥验证]\n    V1 --&gt; R{有效?}\n  end</pre><p>下表厘清密钥交换与数字签名的角色差异——把二者搞混（比如以为有了签名就有了保密）是协议设计的常见误区：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>密钥交换（ECDH/DH）</th>\n<th>数字签名（EdDSA/ECDSA）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>解决的问题</td>\n<td>协商共享对称密钥</td>\n<td>验证来源与完整性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>私钥用途</td>\n<td>计算共享密钥</td>\n<td>生成签名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>公钥用途</td>\n<td>参与协商</td>\n<td>验证签名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全属性</td>\n<td>保密性、前向保密</td>\n<td>真实性、不可否认性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型算法</td>\n<td>X25519、ECDH、DH</td>\n<td>Ed25519、ECDSA、RSA-PSS</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"diffie-hellman-在监听下协商秘密\">Diffie-Hellman：在监听下协商秘密</h2><p>Diffie-Hellman 密钥交换是密码学史上最优雅的构造之一。其经典形式建立在离散对数难题上：双方公开约定一个大素数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 和生成元 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>；Alice 选私密的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 算出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A = g^a \\bmod p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 发给 Bob，Bob 选私密的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 算出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mi>b</mi></msup><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B = g^b \\bmod p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0435em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 发给 Alice。然后各自计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Alice: </mtext><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>Bob: </mtext><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>b</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup><mspace></mspace><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mspace width=\"0.3333em\"/><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Alice: } B^a = g^{ab},\\quad \\text{Bob: } A^b = g^{ab} \\pmod p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Alice: </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0935em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ab</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Bob: </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0935em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ab</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace allowbreak\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.3333em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>两人得到了相同的共享密钥 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>g</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g^{ab}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0435em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ab</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，而全程监听的攻击者只看到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>g</mi><mi>a</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g^a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8588em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>g</mi><mi>b</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g^b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0435em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，要从中算出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>g</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g^{ab}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0435em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ab</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 就得求解离散对数——计算上不可行。椭圆曲线版本 ECDH 把指数运算换成曲线上的标量乘法，共享密钥是点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">abG</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>，安全性来自 <a href=\"elliptic-curve\">椭圆曲线密码</a> 讲的 ECDLP。</p>\n<p>DH 最重要的衍生价值是前向保密（forward secrecy）：如果每次会话都用临时（ephemeral）的一次性 DH 密钥对（记作 ECDHE），那么即便服务器的长期私钥日后泄露，过去截存的流量也无法被解密——因为解密所需的临时私钥早已销毁。这是现代 TLS 必须采用 ECDHE 而非静态 RSA 密钥传输的根本原因，详见 <a href=\"../protocols/tls-secure-comm\">TLS 与安全通信</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数字签名-私钥锁-公钥验\">数字签名：私钥锁、公钥验</h2><p>数字签名要做到三件事：证明消息出自特定私钥持有者（真实性）、证明消息未被改动（完整性）、使签名者无法事后抵赖（不可否认性）。流程总是「先哈希、再签名」——因为公钥运算慢，且消息可能很长，所以先用 <a href=\"../foundations/hash-mac\">哈希与消息认证</a> 把消息压成定长摘要，再对摘要做私钥运算。验证方用公钥对签名做逆运算，看是否还原出同一摘要。</p>\n<p>主流签名方案各有取舍。RSA-PSS 基于分解难题，签名大但验证快、生态成熟。ECDSA 基于 ECDLP，签名短，但有个致命陷阱：每次签名都要用一个一次性随机数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，一旦 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 被复用或可预测，攻击者能直接解出私钥——索尼 PS3 与早期比特币钱包都因此被盗。EdDSA（Ed25519）正是为根除这个陷阱而生：它把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 改为由私钥和消息确定性地派生，彻底消除了对随机数质量的依赖，同时天然恒定时间、抗侧信道。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>签名方案</th>\n<th>安全根基</th>\n<th>签名大小</th>\n<th>随机数风险</th>\n<th>推荐度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>RSA-PSS</td>\n<td>大整数分解</td>\n<td>大（256+ 字节）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>兼容场景可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ECDSA</td>\n<td>ECDLP</td>\n<td>小（64 字节）</td>\n<td>高（k 复用即泄私钥）</td>\n<td>谨慎使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ed25519</td>\n<td>ECDLP（Edwards）</td>\n<td>小（64 字节）</td>\n<td>无（确定性 k）</td>\n<td>新系统首选</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"kem-视角-把公钥统一成-封装密钥\">KEM 视角：把公钥统一成「封装密钥」</h2><p>随着后量子时代到来，密钥交换正被重新抽象为 KEM（密钥封装机制）。KEM 不再让双方「协商」，而是：接收方公开公钥，发送方用该公钥「封装」出一对（密文，共享密钥），把密文发回，接收方用私钥「解封」得到同一把共享密钥。RSA 加密一把随机会话密钥本质就是一种 KEM，而后量子的 ML-KEM 也采用这一接口——这种统一让协议能以最小改动从经典切换到抗量子算法。</p>\n<p>这正是 2026 年过渡策略的关键：把经典的 X25519 密钥交换与后量子的 ML-KEM 封装组合成混合 KEM，会话密钥同时依赖两者。Signal 的 PQXDH、TLS 的 X25519MLKEM768 都是这一思路的产物，分别见 <a href=\"../protocols/end-to-end-encryption\">端到端加密</a> 与 <a href=\"../frontier/post-quantum\">后量子密码</a>。数字签名也在向后量子迁移，对应 ML-DSA、SLH-DSA，将取代 ECDSA/RSA 用于证书与软件签名，详见 <a href=\"../protocols/authentication-pki\">认证与 PKI</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>密钥交换求保密（协商共享密钥），数字签名求真实+不可否认（私钥签、公钥验），方向恰好相反。</li>\n<li>Diffie-Hellman 让双方在公开监听下算出相同的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>g</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g^{ab}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0435em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ab</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，ECDH 是其椭圆曲线版本；用临时密钥即得前向保密。</li>\n<li>签名流程恒为「先哈希再签名」；ECDSA 因每次签名的一次性随机数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 可被复用而危险，Ed25519 用确定性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 根除此患。</li>\n<li>新系统签名首选 Ed25519，兼容场景可用 RSA-PSS，ECDSA 需格外谨慎。</li>\n<li>KEM 把密钥交换统一为「封装/解封」接口，使经典 X25519 与后量子 ML-KEM 能组合成混合方案平滑过渡。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"密钥交换与数字签名","id":"密钥交换与数字签名"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Diffie-Hellman：在监听下协商秘密","id":"diffie-hellman-在监听下协商秘密"},{"level":2,"text":"数字签名：私钥锁、公钥验","id":"数字签名-私钥锁-公钥验"},{"level":2,"text":"KEM 视角：把公钥统一成「封装密钥」","id":"kem-视角-把公钥统一成-封装密钥"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"椭圆曲线密码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/applied-cryptography/public-key/elliptic-curve"},"next":{"title":"TLS 与安全通信","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/applied-cryptography/protocols/tls-secure-comm"}}